#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:6
#: 6c13755f2eab4b79a2abb734180e81d6
msgid "Throttle Based Dynamic Notch Setup"
msgstr "基于油门的动态陷波滤波器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:10
#: cc50d45cee134ac48bbf7f8d3d20bca0
msgid ""
"If you do not have ESC telemetry or an RPM sensor, and are not using an "
"autopilot capable of using the in-flight FFT mode, then throttle-based "
"(:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 1 , or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = 1) center frequency control is best."
msgstr ""
"如果您没有电调数传或转速传感器，且不使用支持飞行中 FFT 模式的飞控，则基于油门的（:ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE "
"<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` = 1 或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE <INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = "
"1）中心频率控制是最佳选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:12
#: 5219509e9c774fae9eacb8fb6c7d2ed2
msgid ""
"In order to configure the throttle-based dynamic harmonic notch filter it is"
" important to identify  the motor noise at the hover throttle level. To do "
"this we need to use the :ref:`common-raw-imu-logging` to obtain logs for "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"为了配置基于油门的动态谐波陷波滤波器，重要的是在悬停油门水平下识别电机噪声。为此，我们需要使用 :ref:`common-raw-imu-"
"logging` 获取日志进行分析。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:14
#: 3fcf4c5308a948b29cef219450e1515f
msgid ""
"Once this is done, the center frequency of the notch(s) can be set and other"
" parameters configured:"
msgstr "完成后，可以设置陷波滤波器的中心频率并配置其他参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:16
#: 50eb371c1b464e55b6fa27b20ffa8119
msgid ""
"if the autopilot is capable of running the FFT (most F4 based autopilots are"
" NOT), then by enabling the :ref:`FFT_ENABLE<FFT_ENABLE>` and using the RC "
"Auxiliary function \"162\" (Auto Throttle Notch Setup) during a sustained "
"hover, the center frequency, :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>`, "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>`, and :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE "
"<INS_HNTCH_MODE>` will automatically be setup for the first notch, avoiding "
"log analysis to determine center frequency as outline below:"
msgstr ""
"如果飞控能够运行 FFT（大多数基于 F4 的飞控不支持），则可以在持续悬停期间启用 :ref:`FFT_ENABLE<FFT_ENABLE>` 并使用"
" RC 辅助功能 「162」（自动油门陷波设置），自动设置第一个陷波的中心频率 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>`、:ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` 和 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>`，从而避免如下所述的日志分析来确定中心频率："

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:19
#: 91f09e2d01564189948133c126304bf3
msgid "Harmonic Notch Configuration for Throttle Based Mode"
msgstr "油门模式下谐波陷波滤波器配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:21
#: e8425d4bdb0a45b3ad743b3751e309dc
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = 1."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:22
#: 54f0d24b9c1b4cf4aca558f9250b3a2a
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE"
" <INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable the harmonic notch"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE "
"<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` = 1 以启用谐波陷波"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:23
#: fde4ce64a72242e1b87e4a975f870792
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` = *hover_thrust* to set the harmonic notch reference value"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` = *hover_thrust* 以设置谐波陷波参考值"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:24
#: 329fca9f519e4ea8a156cd131ca68cd1
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` = *hover_freq* to set the harmonic notch reference "
"frequency"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` = *hover_freq* 以设置谐波陷波参考频率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:25
#: 54a522bfdc0e462fb69a789e525bbf10
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW <INS_HNTCH_BW>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_BW "
"<INS_HNTC2_BW>` = *hover_freq* / 2 to set the harmonic notch bandwidth"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW <INS_HNTCH_BW>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_BW <INS_HNTC2_BW>`"
" = *hover_freq* / 2 以设置谐波陷波带宽"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:26
#: 6e8f6ad56890446393fbdc36ca6a9065
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FM_RAT<INS_HNTCH_FM_RAT>` and/or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_FM_RAT<INS_HNTC2_FM_RAT>` to the percentage of "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` that you desire the notch frequency to track below hover "
"throttle. Note that lower frequency notch filters will have more phase lag "
"and can impact stability. If you want throttle based notch filtering to be "
"effective at a throttle up to 30% below the configured notch frequency then "
"set this parameter to 0.7. The default of 1.0 means the notch will not go "
"below the frequency in the :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ <INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FM_RAT<INS_HNTCH_FM_RAT>` 和/或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_FM_RAT<INS_HNTC2_FM_RAT>` 设置为您希望陷波频率在悬停油门以下跟踪时的 "
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` 的百分比。注意，较低频率的陷波滤波器会产生更多相位滞后，可能影响稳定性。如果希望基于油门的陷波滤波在配置陷波频率以下"
" 30% 的油门处有效，则将此参数设为 0.7。默认值 1.0 表示陷波不会低于 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ <INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` 参数中的频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:27
#: 7b7f23bf803349fb96bf23bb8ea2f3c5
msgid ""
"Setting bit 1 of :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>`, or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>`, will enable each harmonic filter to "
"track each motor, individually for its throttle input, rather than by the "
"average overall throttle."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` 的第 1 "
"位，将使每个谐波滤波器根据各自的油门输入单独跟踪每个电机，而不是根据平均总油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:29
#: 0a2657a9e72e40f38b67ba1904905d93
msgid ""
"If you set bit 1 of :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>`, or "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>`, the bandwidth should not be half the "
"frequency(default). It should be greatly reduced as more notches (one for "
"each motor) cause more phase lag (i.e. latency), thus the bandwidth needs to"
" be reduced to maintain a reasonable phase lag, else oscillation and a "
"poorer tune will result despite the more accurate filtering compared to "
"throttle-based filtering. The suggested starting point is setting the "
"_FREQ/_BW params to 4/1 ratio instead of the default 2/1. This is because "
"for notch filters, a wider bandwidth causes a greater phase lag per notch. "
"You can also use the `Filter Tool "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/FilterTool/>`__ to check the phase lag"
" for your chosen filtering settings. If your phase lag is higher than it was"
" with the single peak filtering, then you can try reducing the bandwidth "
"even further, balancing the phase lag and the amount of noise in the system."
" Check the performance of the filter(s) after setup by doing another post "
"filter configuration test flight as discussed in the :ref:`common-imu-"
"batchsampling` or :ref:`common-raw-imu-logging` page for this and analyze "
"the logs."
msgstr ""
"如果设置了 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_OPTS<INS_HNTCH_OPTS>` 或 "
":ref:`INS_HNTC2_OPTS<INS_HNTC2_OPTS>` 的第 1 "
"位，带宽不应为频率的一半（默认值）。由于更多陷波（每个电机一个）会导致更多相位滞后（即延迟），需要大幅减小带宽以维持合理的相位滞后，否则尽管相对于基于油门滤波具有更精确的滤波效果，仍会导致振荡和更差的调参结果。建议的起始点是将"
" _FREQ/_BW 参数设为 4/1 比例而非默认的 2/1 比例，这是因为对于陷波滤波器，更宽的带宽会在每个陷波处产生更大的相位滞后。您也可以使用 "
"`Filter Tool <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/FilterTool/>`__ "
"检查所选滤波设置的相位滞后。如果您的相位滞后高于单峰滤波时的值，可以尝试进一步减小带宽，在相位滞后和系统噪声量之间取得平衡。设置完成后，按照 "
":ref:`common-imu-batchsampling` 或 :ref:`common-raw-imu-logging` "
"页面中的说明进行飞行后滤波配置测试飞行并分析日志，以检查滤波器的性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:34
#: f69b21bf38234a22bb15fc3ead66228e
msgid "Advanced Notch Frequency Scaling Adjustment in Throttle Based Mode"
msgstr "油门模式下陷波频率缩放的高级调整"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:36
#: f1655cf2e0e440c292429cbba8a395d0
msgid ""
"The harmonic notch is designed to match the motor noise frequency as it "
"changes by interpreting the throttle value. The frequency is scaled up from "
"the hover frequency and will never go below this frequency. However, in "
"dynamic flight it is quite common to hit quite low motor frequencies during "
"propwash. In order to address this it is possible to change the ref value in"
" order to scale from a lower frequency."
msgstr ""
"谐波陷波滤波器通过解读油门值来匹配电机噪声频率的变化。频率从悬停频率向上缩放，永远不会低于此频率。然而，在动态飞行中，电机在螺旋桨尾流期间频率可能相当低。为解决此问题，可以更改参考值以从较低频率开始缩放。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:38
#: 2557785f107c499e8ac06af6b7fad08d
msgid ""
"First perform a long dynamic flight using your current settings and post-"
"filter batch logging. Examine the FFT and look at how far the motor noise "
"peak extends below the hover frequency. Use this frequency - *min_freq* - as"
" the lower bound of your scaling. Then in order to calculate an updated "
"value of the throttle reference use:"
msgstr ""
"首先使用当前设置和滤波后批量日志记录进行长时间动态飞行。检查 "
"FFT，查看电机噪声峰值在悬停频率以下延伸的范围。使用该频率（*min_freq*）作为缩放的下限。然后为了计算更新后的油门参考值，使用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-throttle-based-notch.rst:40
#: 66e3895e9191427c937f4ae8f1205b1e
msgid ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` = *hover_thrust* * SQUARE(*min_freq / hover_freq*)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` = *hover_thrust* * SQUARE(*min_freq / hover_freq*)"
